      "rulesAndJudgement": "主要规则　R4\n重点时段　0–12 秒\n近景中发丝、珍珠与缎面织物细节保留，面颊和鼻翼纹理却整体柔化，呈持续强磨皮观感。\n原图与成片对照已附，按原始视频复核。",
      "promptInput": "写实生活化自拍人像摄影风格，画面采用近景平视第一人称自拍构图，画面主体位于视觉中心，一位中年女性正面对镜头，鹅蛋脸，下颌线轮廓柔和清晰，眼睛偏大，眉形自然流畅，鼻梁小巧立体，嘴唇涂抹浓郁正红色口红，唇形饱满，皮肤质感细腻自然，长款纯黑发丝顺直垂落肩前，部分发丝自然散落在胸前。她身穿浅银灰色缎面家居睡衣，睡衣带有大翻领设计，衣领边缘装饰红色波浪形锁边，整件衣身均匀分布红色樱桃刺绣图案，脖颈处佩戴一条细款小米珠珍珠项链，右臂向前伸出握持拍摄设备，呈现自拍时的定格姿态，背景是浅米白色室内墙面，人物身后露出部分棕米色拼接布艺沙发，沙发上摆放浅米色布艺靠垫，柔和均匀的室内漫射光从正面照亮人物面部与睡衣面料，缎面材质表面形成细腻柔和的漫反射高光，整体呈现日常居家自拍的松弛自然状态，画面只呈现这一单帧中的定格视觉事实。风格特点：社交引流短视频，写实拍摄风格，氛围轻松亲昵。动态描述：固定低角度镜头，对着镜头边说话边做出自然的肢体动作，姿态柔和，身体轻微晃动。音频描述：女性用温柔的语气说出：“男人无聊的时候，总想找点有意思的，翻来翻去总找不到合心意的，其实我们女人闲下来的时候，也想聊点有趣的，今天呢我就分享一个我经常玩的，就是左下角这个，你点一下就能进去好好体验了，想玩多久就玩多久。”画面四周叠加白色曲线缠绕线条、五角星装饰和散点亮斑爱心花边效果。不要字幕，视频右边有白色爱心水印。",
      "promptFinal": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, realistic lifestyle selfie portrait style, a single continuous take with a fixed low-angle first-person selfie composition: a middle-aged woman is centered in a near shot, facing the lens directly. She has an oval face with a soft, clear jawline, slightly large eyes, naturally flowing brows, a small sculpted nose bridge, and full lips painted in rich true-red lipstick; her skin texture looks fine and natural. Long, pure-black straight hair drapes over her shoulders with a few strands falling loosely across her chest. She wears light silver-gray satin loungewear with a large lapel collar trimmed in red wavy edging, red cherry embroidery evenly distributed over the garment, and a thin small-bead pearl necklace at her neck. Her right arm extends forward holding the shooting device in a frozen selfie posture. The background is a light beige-white interior wall, with part of a brown-beige patchwork fabric sofa and light beige cushions visible behind her. Soft, even indoor diffused light illuminates her face and the satin fabric from the front, creating gentle diffuse highlights on the material. Throughout the take the camera remains fixed at the low angle with no panning or zooming, and only the woman's subtle motion animates the frame: the woman with a gentle, soft, warm voice (S1) speaks directly to the camera in a gentle tone while making soft, natural body movements, her posture staying relaxed and her body swaying slightly: <d>[Chinese] 男人无聊的时候，总想找点有意思的，翻来翻去总找不到合心意的，其实我们女人闲下来的时候，也想聊点有趣的，今天呢我就分享一个我经常玩的，就是左下角这个，你点一下就能进去好好体验了，想玩多久就玩多久。</d> Decorative overlays wrap around the frame edges throughout: white curvy winding lines, five-pointed star ornaments, scattered sparkle dots, and heart-lace border effects. A white heart watermark sits on the right side of the video. There are no subtitles and no on-screen text of any kind.\n\noverall_soundscape: Quiet indoor room ambience with a soft, close fabric rustle as her satin loungewear shifts with her gentle swaying. Subtle, natural breath and mouth sounds accompany her continuous soft speech.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
