      "rulesAndJudgement": "主要规则　R1\n重点时段　9–11秒\n男子近景额头、鼻梁、双颊与下巴出现连续偏亮的反射，脸部表面呈油润光泽；与背景及衣领对比可观察反光覆盖范围。提示词设定室内暖光与潮湿空气，需结合场景判断，不能仅凭脸亮或环境潮湿定错。\n原视频及问题定位帧已附，结合完整片段复核。",
      "promptInput": "|时长|镜头|画面|台词|运镜/光影/音效|\n| ---- | ---- | ---- | ---- | ---- |\n|0-1|近景|△许清婉抱着糯糯，指尖攥紧，眉眼间满是忐忑不安。|许清婉：墨川，我还是觉得你太冲动了。|固定近景，煤油灯暖光，氛围安静|\n|0-2|中景|△沈墨川没有应声，独自迈步走到糊着油布的窗边，望向山下方向。|无|跟拍背影，脚步轻缓|\n|0-3|远景推镜|△顺着沈墨川的视线向外，黄泥湾铺展在眼底，原来自家青砖瓦房浸在落日余晖之中，沈福来一家已经住进去，房顶烟囱飘起袅袅炊烟。|无|慢推远景，落日暖橙色调|\n|0-4|侧脸特写|△沈墨川静静望着下方院落，压低声音开口。|沈墨川：住吧，好好住。七天以后，这房子白送给我，我都不会再踏进一步半步。|侧拍，声音低沉|\n|0-5|特写|△山口吹来山风，油布边角微微鼓动，潮湿闷腥的水汽涌入石屋。|无|镜头给到晃动的油布，风声慢慢加重|\n|0-6|面部特写|△沈墨川鼻尖轻轻翕动，嗅到水汽，眉头骤然紧紧皱起。|沈墨川（内心）：这风里，有水的味道。不是河水里，是暴雨将至的那种闷湿。比他预想的，要早。|定格眼神特写，压抑氛围感音效|",
      "promptFinal": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic period drama, a fixed close-up frames Xu Qingwan holding little Nuonuo in her arms, her fingertips clenched tight, her eyes full of anxiety. A kerosene lamp casts warm flickering light across their faces in the hushed stone house. The quiet, tense young woman (S1) says softly: <d>[Chinese] 墨川，我还是觉得你太冲动了。</d> [Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the shot cuts to a medium view from behind: Shen Mochuan gives no reply and walks slowly with quiet footsteps toward the window sealed with oiled cloth, gazing down toward the mountain foot. The camera trails his back with a gentle tracking move. [Shot 3] At 00:04.000, the shot cuts to a slow push-in along his line of sight, revealing a wide vista: Huangniwan village spreads below, and the family's old brick-tile house sits steeped in the warm-orange glow of the setting sun. Shen Fulai's family has already moved in; a thin curl of chimney smoke rises from the roof. [Shot 4] At 00:06.000, the shot cuts to a side-profile close-up of Shen Mochuan staring silently down at the courtyard below. In a low, deep voice (S2) he says: <d>[Chinese] 住吧，好好住。七天以后，这房子白送给我，我都不会再踏进一步半步。</d> [Shot 5] At 00:08.000, the shot cuts to a close view of the oiled cloth window: a mountain wind gusts through the pass, the cloth's edges fluttering and bulging slightly as damp, musty water vapor pours into the stone house. [Shot 6] At 00:10.000, the shot cuts to a held extreme close-up of Shen Mochuan's face: his nostrils twitch faintly as he catches the scent, and his brows knit tightly. He says in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] 这风里，有水的味道。不是河水里，是暴雨将至的那种闷湿。比他预想的，要早。</d> while his lips remain completely closed. His eyes hold on the oiled cloth as the oppressive, foreboding ambience closes the scene.\n\noverall_soundscape: The stone house is hushed under the faint hiss of the kerosene lamp flame. Slow quiet footsteps cross the floor, then mountain wind rises steadily outside, the oiled cloth flapping and swelling as humid air seeps into the room.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Sparse low strings at a slow tempo, gradually darkening in tone and swelling slightly as the wind rises, fading into a sustained dissonant drone at the end.",
