      "rulesAndJudgement": "主要规则：R1｜油膜反光/异常油光\n问题定位：约 6.8 秒（原帧 6.800s）\n人物 / 部位：老年女性额部、鼻梁与上颊\n判定依据：额部、鼻梁与上颊可见亮面，眼周和嘴周保留细纹，亮面区域的过渡更平整。证据展示高光分布及其与周围纹理的反差。\n截图位置：本行「视频上传 / 预览」列，原视频下方。",
      "promptInput": "the man on the left: a 67-year-old Japanese man with short gray-white hair, calm face, wearing a dark blue casual jacket faces the woman on the center: a 62-year-old Japanese woman with short gray-black slightly curled hair, natural wrinkles, wearing a beige knit cardigan and dark work apron, his hands slightly trembling, in an old Western-tailoring alteration studio in Kanazawa, vintage sewing machines, fabric rolls, wooden worktable, soft afternoon daylight through windows, warm nostalgic atmosphere, slow push-in to facial close-up, soft natural afternoon light, realistic family drama style, cinematic quality, no subtitles, no on-screen text, the man on the left says: 資産は二百億円以上あります。明日、私と婚姻届を出しませんか。 Clear Japanese speech, synchronized sound",
      "promptFinal": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, realistic family drama style, a medium shot frames an old Western-tailoring alteration studio in Kanazawa bathed in soft afternoon daylight through the windows, with vintage sewing machines along the walls, fabric rolls stacked near a worn wooden worktable, and dust motes drifting in the warm light. On the left, a 67-year-old Japanese man with short gray-white hair and a calm face, wearing a dark blue casual jacket, faces the woman in the center — a 62-year-old Japanese woman with short gray-black slightly curled hair, natural wrinkles, wearing a beige knit cardigan over a dark work apron — his hands trembling slightly at his sides. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward the man's face as he speaks with a clear, low, measured voice, his lips moving in precise synchronization: <d>[Japanese] 資産は二百億円以上あります。明日、私と婚姻届を出しませんか。</d> The push-in settles into a facial close-up as he finishes the line, the woman listening with a quietly serious expression, the warm natural afternoon light remaining consistent throughout.\n\noverall_soundscape: Quiet studio room tone with a faint hum of afternoon stillness; the soft rustle of fabric and a subtle tremor of the man's jacket sleeves accompany his speech, while distant street ambience drifts faintly through the windows.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
