      "rulesAndJudgement": "主要规则：R4｜过度磨皮\n问题定位：约 3.4 秒（原帧 3.370s）\n人物 / 部位：厨房女性额头、鼻侧与双颊\n判定依据：额头、鼻侧与双颊呈均匀柔滑质感，眉眼、牙齿和发丝边缘清楚，皮肤微纹理相对弱化；截图避开锅具反光，定位人脸材质。\n截图位置：本行「视频上传 / 预览」列，原视频下方。",
      "promptInput": "Create a photorealistic live-action video, vertical 9:16, 5 seconds. A cheerful young Chinese woman wearing a light beige apron stands in a beautiful modern Chinese home kitchen, holding a stainless steel cooking pot. She looks directly into the camera, smiles, slightly lifts the pot, and points at it.\n\nShe clearly speaks Mandarin Chinese with accurate pronunciation: \"锅，Guō！\"\n\nAdd large clean on-screen educational text:\n\"锅 (Guō) = Panci\"\n\nNatural facial expressions, realistic human movements, accurate lip synchronization, cinematic lighting, professional educational TikTok style. Camera medium close-up, smooth subtle push-in. No cartoon, no animation, no watermark.",
      "promptFinal": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Photorealistic live-action, professional educational TikTok style, a medium close-up frames a cheerful young Chinese woman wearing a light beige apron, standing centered in a beautiful modern Chinese home kitchen with warm cinematic lighting, soft daylight from a window, and clean countertops and contemporary cabinetry softly blurred behind her. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed throughout the shot. She looks directly into the camera and smiles warmly, then slightly lifts the stainless steel cooking pot in her hands toward the lens and points at it with a friendly, teaching gesture. She clearly speaks Mandarin Chinese with accurate pronunciation and precise lip synchronization: <d>[Chinese] 锅，Guō！</d> Large clean educational on-screen text appears legibly on screen: \"锅 (Guō) = Panci\". Her facial expressions remain natural and engaging, her movements realistic and smooth, with no cartoon, animation, or watermark elements.\n\noverall_soundscape: A quiet modern kitchen ambience with a faint room tone and soft daylight atmosphere. The stainless steel pot makes a light metallic shift as she lifts it, followed by the soft tap of her fingertip pointing at it.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A light, upbeat ukulele-and-clap pattern at a moderate tempo, gentle and clean, fading out at the end.",
