      "rulesAndJudgement": "主要规则 R1＋R2＋R3＋R4\n检查主体 00:06-00:09 耶稣装扮男性近景（00:04-00:05 红衣女孩面部也有类似特征）\n检查位置 7.50 秒附近\n判定 00:06-00:09 男性角色面部皮肤完全没有毛孔和微纹理，呈现出典型的塑料或蜡质手感（R2/R3/R4）。最明显的是其鼻尖及双颊，出现了大面积、边缘生硬且过于饱和的红色镜面高光，油腻反光感极强，看起来像是涂了厚重的油脂或被覆膜（R1）。整个面部肤色均匀得极其不自然，缺乏真实皮肤的血色变化。",
      "promptInput": "【画面与机位】：9:16竖屏，广播级手提ENG便携摄像机纪实实况（突发新闻现场感，自然现场杂光捕捉，真实手持变焦抽拉）。实地于暴风雨即将来临的高原风化岩石戈壁大道（低沉墨黑阴云压向地面，狂风撕扯枯草，车辙在砂砾碎石路面上急促飞驰）。【人物造型】：小女孩为梳着自然微卷双马尾、穿着酒红色羊毛背带裙内搭白衬衫的小女孩，小脸被高原冷风吹得红扑扑，神态灵动逼真；开门探身的耶稣为身穿浅驼色做旧重磅亚麻开衫，领口磨损起球，微卷络腮胡修剪整齐，双手布满劳作纹理，眼神极具情感穿透力。【运镜与动作】：低机位中景仰拍缓缓跟进。雪山石教堂古老笨重的原木门前，编着双马尾辫的小女孩迈着小步上前用力敲响生锈铸铁门环；白袍披肩的耶稣带着温润微光从容拉开木门探身而出；小女孩敏捷转身伸出肉嘟嘟的小食指直指镜头向耶稣大声告状；耶稣眼神化作无尽慈爱，微笑着直视屏幕温和抚慰并号召大家证明小女孩说谎。【音频与对白】：[女孩/稚嫩清脆嗓音告状，巴西葡萄牙语]：“Veja só, Senhor! A pessoa que está assistindo isso não acredita em você!”\\n[耶稣/温和慈祥醇厚男声，巴西葡萄牙语]：“Mostre que ela mente. Aperte todos os botões ao lado e comente amém.”【质感与音效】：欧洲阿尔卑斯写实晨光与雪山冷冽空气感，木纹裂隙与铸铁锈迹纤毫毕现，小女孩与耶稣的面部微表情极度灵动自然，口型精准匹配。",
      "promptFinal": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, documentary realism, vertical framing, broadcast-grade handheld ENG portable camera with a breaking-news live feel, natural ambient light capture. A low-angle medium shot slowly pushes in toward the ancient heavy log door of a small stone snow-mountain church set on a weathered-rock gobi avenue on a high plateau; ink-black storm clouds press low toward the ground, fierce wind tears at dry grass, and fresh tire tracks streak across the gravel road, all under crisp Alpine morning light with cold, clean air. A little girl with slightly curly twin ponytails, wearing a wine-red wool pinafore dress over a white shirt, her cheeks flushed red by the plateau wind, hurries up in small steps and knocks hard on the rusty cast-iron door knocker, wood grain cracks and iron rust rendered in fine detail. The heavy wooden door swings open and Jesus, in a white robe shawl over a light camel distressed heavy linen cardigan with a frayed pilling collar, neatly trimmed curly beard and labor-worn hands, calmly leans out surrounded by a soft warm glow. The girl nimbly spins around, thrusts her chubby little index finger straight at the lens, and loudly tattles to Jesus — the crisp childlike girl (S1) says: <d>[Portuguese] Veja só, Senhor! A pessoa que está assistindo isso não acredita em você!</d> — with precise lip-sync. Jesus's eyes fill with boundless loving-kindness; he smiles directly into the screen and gently soothes — the gentle, kind, mellow male voice of Jesus (S2) says: <d>[Portuguese] Mostre que ela mente. Aperte todos os botões ao lado e comente amém.</d> — again with accurate lip-sync and extremely natural facial micro-expressions. Mid-shot, the handheld camera performs one brief real zoom pull before settling.\n\noverall_soundscape: Fierce plateau wind howls and rattles dry grass while low thunder rumbles in the distance. The rusty cast-iron knocker strikes the log door with sharp metallic knocks, the heavy wooden door groans open, and gravel crunches under small hurrying footsteps.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
