      "rulesAndJudgement": "主要规则：R2 / R3\n候选程度：轻度边界候选\n问题定位：6.630 秒附近\n少年极近特写的鼻翼和眼下至颊部偏厚重光滑、略有蜡面感，但仍可见皮肤细纹与颗粒。原文明确要求眼眶泛红、含泪，所以泪光、眼红和湿润反射均不作为缺陷；仅复核皮肤材质是否异常。",
      "promptInput": "参考图1为[沉香-基础形象]的角色四视图。\n参考图2为[破旧小屋-基础形象]的场景环境参考图，提供空间结构、背景陈设、材质和光影氛围。\n\n【剧情】\n【0 s - 4 s】中景，平视机位。在@图片2(破旧小屋)中，@图片1(沉香)站在卧榻前，静静聆听着真相。镜头缓慢推近，落在@图片1(沉香)的脸部，画面采用昏沉的室内微弱光线，呈现冷灰压抑的色调，具有写实且沉静的电影质感。@图片1(沉香)原本平静的面部瞬间发生变化，瞳孔猛地一缩，双眼紧紧定格在卧榻上的方向，身体僵硬静止，镜头稳稳落在@图片1(沉香)震惊错愕的眼眸上。\n【4 s - 7 s】特写，平视机位。承接上一镜@图片1(沉香)震惊的落点，镜头切换至@图片1(沉香)眼部极端特写。@图片1(沉香)难以置信，眼眶迅速泛红，泪水在眼眶里打转，始终不肯落下。@图片1(沉香)的视线微微颤动，但始终没有移开，最终将全部悲愤凝滞在泛红的眼眸中，镜头落在@图片1(沉香)泪光盈盈的面庞上。\n\n视频全程不要字幕、不要屏幕文字；必须保留协调统一的全局BGM和必要环境音，禁止静音段。\n\nVisual style: 采用古风仙侠真人写实风格，融合东方古典美学、仙侠世界观与电影级实拍质感。整体唯美、清冷、空灵但保持真实可信，强调真实人物、真实服化道、东方电影摄影、自然肤质与真实布光，具有高品质仙侠影视剧与电影概念设计质感。以下规则仅作用于当前生成目标；未涉及内容不得主动添加。\n【整体画面风格】\n采用电影级真人实拍质感，自然光与真实布光优先，结合晨雾、逆光、月光、柔和天光与环境反射光。整体使用青灰、月白、黛青、米白、浅金等低饱和东方色调，肤色自然，阴影真实，具有柔和轮廓光、空气透视与电影景深。\n4K/8K高清，真实皮肤，真实服化道，东方电影摄影，自然光影，仙侠电影质感。避免3D CG、二次元、塑料皮肤、过度磨皮、影楼古风、廉价发光特效、高饱和仙气、强HDR与风格漂移。",
      "promptFinal": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is Chen Xiang (沉香)， the teenage boy defined by <Picture 1>: messy black hair tied in a topknot bun with loose strands framing his face, natural skin texture, dark eyes, a worn slate-blue Chinese frog-buttoned tunic with frayed beige patches on shoulders and hem, loose beige linen trousers, and straw sandals. His face, hair, costume, and proportions must be preserved exactly; his eye performance is the emotional core of the video.\n<Subject 2> is the dilapidated earthen hut interior from <Picture 2>: earthen walls, a low dark-clothed couch (卧榻) against the back wall, a cracked clay jar with dried herbs on a wooden bench, an old wooden bucket, torn yellow talisman papers with faded calligraphy on the left wall, a broken hole in the wall admitting faint cold light, a weathered wooden door with a rag, a small lit oil lamp casting a warm orange glow at lower right, and straw and woven mats on the dirt floor. Its spatial layout, materials, and dim cold-grey lighting mood anchor the whole scene.\n<Picture 1> is the character turnaround sheet of <Subject 1>, providing his identity reference for both shots.\n<Picture 2> is the environment reference for <Subject 2>, providing the full set, props, and lighting mood of Shot 1 and the ambient light continuity of Shot 2.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 7-second cinematic live-action xianxia scene set inside <Subject 2>, the dilapidated earthen hut from <Picture 2>. <Subject 1>, Chen Xiang from <Picture 1>, stands silently before the low couch, listening to a devastating truth; his calm shatters into shock, then the camera cuts to an extreme close-up of his reddening, tear-brimming eyes. <Picture 1> drives his identity and <Picture 2> drives the environment and lighting; no dialogue, no on-screen text, and a continuous melancholic Chinese-style score with ambient room tone throughout.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - his messy black topknot with loose strands, patched slate-blue tunic, natural skin, and dark eyes are retained exactly; only his expression changes from calm to shock to grief.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], with lighting continuity into [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the couch, earthen walls, talisman papers, clay herb jar, wooden bucket, oil lamp glow, broken wall hole, and dirt floor are retained with their dim cold-grey mood.\n<Picture 1> (identity reference for [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - Chen Xiang's face, hair, costume, and proportions follow the turnaround sheet.\n<Picture 2> (environment reference for [Shot 1], light continuity for [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the hut's layout, props, materials, and dim cold-grey lighting with the single warm lamp accent are preserved.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a 7-second cinematic live-action xianxia scene in true Eastern classical realism: real skin texture, real worn fabrics, film-grade depth of field, natural motivated lighting, and a low-saturation cold grey-blue palette (青灰/月白/黛青) with a single dim warm accent from the oil lamp. No subtitles or on-screen text of any kind appear.\n[Shot 1] The scene opens at 0.0 s on a medium shot at eye level inside <Subject 2>, the dilapidated earthen hut at night. <Subject 1>, Chen Xiang exactly as in <Picture 1> — messy black topknot with loose strands, patched slate-blue frog-button tunic — stands motionless before the low dark couch (卧榻)， quietly listening to a truth spoken by someone off-screen. The earthen wall, torn yellow talisman papers, cracked clay jar with dried herbs, and the warm orange glow of the oil lamp at lower right are visible in the dim environment; faint cold light seeps through the broken hole in the wall, wrapping the scene in an oppressive cold-grey tone. The camera performs a slow, steady push-in toward his face. Around 2.5 s his composed expression shatters in an instant: his pupils contract sharply, his eyes lock hard onto the direction of the couch, and his whole body goes rigid and still. The push-in settles firmly on his stunned, shocked eyes as the shot ends at 4.0 s.\n[Shot 2] At 4.0 s, a single hard cut to an extreme close-up at eye level of <Subject 1>'s eyes, directly continuing from Shot 1's landing point. The camera is essentially static with only micro-stability. Disbelief takes over: the rims of his eyes quickly redden, tears well up and tremble but never fall. His gaze quivers slightly yet never looks away, all grief and indignation freezing in his reddened, tear-glistening eyes; a faint warm reflection of the oil lamp shimmers in his irises against the cold ambient light. The final frames rest on his brimming, sorrowful gaze as the video ends at 7.0 s.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA quiet old-hut room tone continues throughout: faint cold wind whispering through the broken wall hole, the soft flicker of the oil-lamp flame, and the stillness of the earthen interior, kept low and continuous with no silent gaps.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA coherent, unified melancholic Chinese-style score runs continuously across the full 7 seconds — sparse guzheng and low di strings, slow and sorrowful — swelling very subtly at the 4.0 s cut into the eye close-up, with no silent gaps anywhere.",
