      "rulesAndJudgement": "主要规则　R1\n重点时段　8–9.5秒\n发际下方至额头中部出现连续亮区，鼻背及两颊反光同步增强，近景中保持油润、打蜡般的表面观感。\n原图与成片对照已附，按原始视频复核。",
      "promptInput": "（旁白统一用女声）\n【角色锁定】[Reference Image 1]徐建国，浑厚沉稳的成年男声，音质厚实，带有军人的威严和正气。 @全村老少，群体声音。\n【场景锁定】[Reference Image 2]乡间泥泞盘山公路。\n【视频风格】真人电影感，写实表演，自然光影，实拍级皮肤质感与毛发细节。\n\n\n【镜头1，0-3秒】全景，场景为[Reference Image 2]乡间泥泞盘山公路\n内容：@全村老少 站在[Reference Image 2]乡间泥泞盘山公路 两侧，道路笔直延伸，两侧栽满迎风怒放的向日葵，人群随风律动。\n运镜：推镜头：镜头向主体缓慢推进。\n台词：@全村老少（高声歌唱）：“春风吹绿千层浪，”\n音效：歌声嘹亮，风吹向日葵丛的沙沙声。\n\n【镜头2，3-6秒】中景，场景仍为[Reference Image 2]乡间泥泞盘山公路\n内容：@全村老少 继续歌唱，表情激动，部分村民手搭凉棚或挥舞手臂。\n运镜：跟拍：镜头跟随队伍横向移动。\n台词：@全村老少（高声歌唱）：“高管返乡换新装，好日子万年长！”\n音效：歌声达到高潮，欢呼声隐现。\n\n【镜头3，6-8秒】近景，场景仍为[Reference Image 2]乡间泥泞盘山公路\n内容：[Reference Image 1]徐建国 站在道路中央，身穿旧迷彩服，黑色板寸头，古铜色皮肤，神情坚毅，缓缓抬起双臂。\n运镜：固定镜头。\n台词：[Reference Image 1]徐建国（振臂高呼，前半句）：“大步流星向前奔，”\n音效：环境音压低，突出人声。\n\n【镜头4，8-10秒】特写，场景仍为[Reference Image 2]乡间泥泞盘山公路\n内容：[Reference Image 1]徐建国 面部特写，眼神明亮，嘴巴张大喊出后半句，背景中@全村老少 模糊可见，掌声响起。\n运镜：镜头缓慢拉远。\n台词：[Reference Image 1]徐建国（振臂高呼，后半句）：“幸福是靠自己双手真刀真枪干出来的！”\n音效：掌声雷动，歌声回响。",
      "promptFinal": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is 徐建国, the adult Chinese man defined by <Picture 1>: black buzz-cut hair, bronze-tanned weathered skin, stern resolute expression, wearing an old mottled-green digital camouflage jacket, olive cargo trousers, and black combat boots. He stands at the center of the road in Shots 3–4, raising his arms and shouting the rallying cry.\n<Subject 2> is 全村老少, the whole village crowd of men, women, elderly, and children lining both sides of the road, singing loudly with excited expressions, some shading their eyes or waving their arms. Generated per intent with consistent villager appearance; no separate reference image.\n<Subject 3> is the environment from <Picture 2>: the muddy mountain road rendered as stretching straight ahead, with wet ruts and puddles, a guardrail, rocky green slopes, misty blue-green mountain ranges, and a dramatic cloudy sky with sun rays — modified per intent with rows of blooming sunflowers lining both sides, swaying in the wind.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 10-second live-action cinematic-realistic scene on the muddy mountain road of <Subject 3> (from <Picture 2>). <Subject 2> 全村老少 sings in unison along both sides of the sunflower-lined road (Shots 1–2), then <Subject 1> 徐建国, whose identity and wardrobe come from <Picture 1>, stands at the road center and shouts the final rallying cry (Shots 3–4) as the crowd erupts in applause. All camera moves follow the user-locked plan; all sound is diegetic.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - face, buzz-cut, bronze-tanned skin, resolute expression, and old camouflage uniform from <Picture 1> are retained throughout.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the crowd of villagers of all ages lining both road sides, singing and gesturing, is retained; in Shot 4 they appear as a blurred cheering background.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): partially_preserved - the muddy road, guardrail, mountains, and cloudy sky from <Picture 2> are retained, modified per intent into a straight stretch with added rows of blooming sunflowers.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a live-action, cinematic-realistic scene shot in natural light on an overcast mountain day with sun rays breaking through, photoreal skin and hair texture, and documentary-style framing.\n[Shot 1] A wide shot establishes <Subject 3>, the muddy mountain road stretching straight ahead with wet ruts, puddles, a guardrail, and misty blue-green mountains under a dramatic cloudy sky with sun rays. Rows of blooming sunflowers line both sides, their heads swaying in the wind. <Subject 2> 全村老少 stands along both edges of the road, bodies swaying with the breeze, singing loudly in unison, <d>[Chinese] 春风吹绿千层浪，</d> The camera performs a slow push-in toward the crowd. Bright group singing carries over the diegetic rustle of wind through the sunflower stalks.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, the shot cuts to a medium shot of <Subject 2> continuing the song, faces excited and flushed; some villagers shade their eyes with a hand (手搭凉棚) or wave their arms. The camera tracks laterally, following the crowd horizontally. The singing reaches its climax as the crowd sings, <d>[Chinese] 高管返乡换新装，好日子万年长！</d> Faint cheers and whistles emerge beneath the song.\n[Shot 3] At 00:06.000, the shot cuts to a close shot at the road center. <Subject 1> 徐建国, with his black buzz-cut, bronze-tanned weathered skin, and old mottled-green digital camouflage jacket from <Picture 1>, stands in the middle of the muddy road, expression stern and resolute, slowly raising both arms. The camera holds static. The ambient sound dips low so his thick, steady, authoritative male voice with military gravity carries prominently as he shouts, <d>[Chinese] 大步流星向前奔，</d>\n[Shot 4] At 00:08.000, the shot cuts to an extreme close-up of <Subject 1>'s face, eyes bright, mouth open mid-shout, <Subject 2> visible only as a blurred cheering background behind him. The camera performs a slow pull-back. He yells the final line, <d>[Chinese] 幸福是靠自己双手真刀真枪干出来的！</d> As he finishes, thunderous applause erupts and his shouted line echoes over the crowd noise through the final frame.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nAll-diegetic sound: wind rustling through the sunflower stalks in Shot 1, loud group singing with rising cheers and whistles in Shot 2, dipped ambience under 徐建国's shouted line in Shot 3, and thunderous applause with song echo in Shot 4.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
