      "rulesAndJudgement": "主要规则　R1\n重点时段　4–7 秒\n额头中心亮斑与鼻梁连续白亮反射同时出现，讲话时皮肤表面持续偏湿亮。\n原图与成片对照已附，按原始视频复核。\n复核边界：室内布光和正常皮脂反射也可能解释部分亮区，需结合完整视频判断，暂作为R1候选。",
      "promptInput": "（旁白统一用女声）\n【角色锁定】[Reference Image 1]张姐，压抑颤抖中年女声，转为坚定。[Reference Image 2]林舒，清亮自然青年女声，音质柔和坚定。\n【场景锁定】[Reference Image 3]城东廉租房内部。\n【视频风格】真人电影感，写实表演，自然光影，实拍级皮肤质感与毛发细节。\n\n【镜头1，0-4秒】中景，场景为[Reference Image 3]城东廉租房内部\n内容：[Reference Image 1]张姐 站在一组老旧木制矮柜前，棕色齐肩短发略显凌乱，神情从忧郁转为坚定。她拉开柜门，手指迅速在杂物中翻找，最终抽出一个厚厚的白色信封。\n运镜：固定镜头，略微向手部和信封推进。\n台词：[Reference Image 1]张姐（压抑颤抖，语速加快）：“这是我之前被他骗时，偷录的所有...”\n音效：柜门滑轨摩擦声“吱呀”，衣物翻动的杂乱声。\n\n【镜头2，4-7秒】近景，场景仍为[Reference Image 3]城东廉租房内部\n内容：[Reference Image 1]张姐 双手紧紧攥着信封，指尖因用力而泛白，眼神锐利地盯着前方。\n运镜：镜头缓慢推近至[Reference Image 1]张姐 面部及手中的信封特写。\n台词：[Reference Image 1]张姐（坚定，音量提高）：“...开房和密谈录音！”\n音效：纸张被抓紧的轻微撕裂感声。\n\n【镜头3，7-10秒】中景，场景仍为[Reference Image 3]城东廉租房内部\n内容：[Reference Image 2]林舒 站在[Reference Image 1]张姐 身侧，黑色直长发垂顺，穿着深蓝色修身西装外套。她小心翼翼地从[Reference Image 1]张姐 手中接过那个厚厚的信封，动作轻柔且谨慎，随后将其放入身旁的黑色公文包中，并拉上拉链。\n运镜：跟拍[Reference Image 2]林舒 的手部动作，最后定格在公文包合上的瞬间。\n台词：[Reference Image 2]林舒（柔和坚定，语速平稳）：“有了这些物证，他的诈骗罪行就彻底坐实了。”\n音效：公文包拉链拉上的顺滑声“滋——”，物体落入包内的闷响。",
      "promptFinal": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is 张姐, the middle-aged Chinese woman in <Picture 1>, with a brown shoulder-length bob slightly messy, natural photographic skin texture, wearing her beige trench coat look; her voice is a suppressed, trembling middle-aged female timbre that turns resolute.\n<Subject 2> is 林舒, the young Chinese woman in <Picture 2>, with long straight black hair, fair skin, wearing a navy tailored blazer; her voice is a clear, natural young female timbre, soft yet firm.\n<Subject 3> is the shabby low-rent apartment interior in <Picture 3> (城东廉租房内部): worn stained walls, metal-frame bed with plaid bedding, small window with blue curtain, cluttered shelves, wooden folding table, dim natural daylight, reflective worn floor.\n<Subject 4> is the thick white envelope containing the recorded evidence, a central prop across all shots.\n<Subject 5> is the old wooden low cabinet with cluttered contents, appearing in Shot 1.\n<Subject 6> is the black briefcase with zipper, appearing in Shot 3 as the final freeze-frame subject.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 10-second live-action cinematic scene set inside <Subject 3>, the low-rent apartment from <Picture 3>. <Subject 1> 张姐 (per <Picture 1>) retrieves a thick white evidence envelope from <Subject 5>, grips it with whitening knuckles, and hands it to <Subject 2> 林舒 (per <Picture 2>), who places it into <Subject 6> and zips it shut. Three shots follow the user-locked camera plan; all dialogue is female-voiced and verbatim; no subtitles or on-screen text.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - 张姐's brown messy bob, trench coat look, facial features, and voice timbre from <Picture 1> are retained throughout.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - 林舒's long straight black hair, navy blazer, and soft-firm young female voice from <Picture 2> are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the worn walls, bed, blue-curtained window, cluttered shelves, and dim natural daylight of <Picture 3> anchor every shot.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the thick white envelope is the continuous central prop from retrieval to storage.\n<Subject 5> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the old wooden low cabinet with cluttered contents is retained.\n<Subject 6> (appears in [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the black briefcase with zipper is retained and ends the video frozen closed.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a 10-second live-action cinematic scene with realistic acting, natural lighting, and photographic skin texture and hair detail; the tone is tense, intimate, and quietly triumphant, with no subtitles or on-screen text.\n[Shot 1] A fixed medium shot inside <Subject 3>, the shabby low-rent apartment: worn stained walls, the metal-frame bed with plaid bedding, and the small window with blue curtain casting dim natural daylight across the reflective worn floor. <Subject 1> 张姐, her brown shoulder-length bob slightly messy, stands before <Subject 5>, the old wooden low cabinet. Her expression shifts from melancholy to determination. She slides the cabinet door open with a “吱呀” friction creak, her fingers rummaging quickly through the clutter amid rustling clothing sounds, and pulls out <Subject 4>, the thick white envelope. The camera holds its fixed framing with a slight push toward her hands and the envelope. <Subject 1> (S1) speaks in a suppressed, trembling, quickening middle-aged female voice, <d>[Chinese] 这是我之前被他骗时，偷录的所有...</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the shot cuts to a close-up in the same setting. The camera pushes in slowly on 张姐's face and the envelope in her hands. Her fingertips whiten from gripping <Subject 4> hard, a faint paper-straining sound audible, her eyes sharp and fixed forward. <Subject 1> (S1) finishes her line firmly and louder, her trembling voice hardening into resolve, <d>[Chinese] ...开房和密谈录音！</d>\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, the shot cuts to a medium shot in the same setting. <Subject 2> 林舒, long straight black hair falling smoothly, wearing her navy tailored blazer, stands at 张姐's side. The camera tracks her hand movements as she carefully, gently takes <Subject 4> from 张姐's hands, places it into <Subject 6>, the black briefcase beside her with a muffled thud, and pulls the zipper shut with a smooth “滋——” sound. The shot ends frozen on the instant the briefcase closes. <Subject 2> (S2) speaks in a soft yet firm, steady young female voice, <d>[Chinese] 有了这些物证，他的诈骗罪行就彻底坐实了。</d>\n\noverall_soundscape:\nAll-diegetic quiet apartment room tone with faint street ambience through the window; cabinet door sliding “吱呀” friction creak and rustling clothes in Shot 1, faint paper straining in Shot 2, muffled thud of the envelope dropping into the briefcase and smooth zipper “滋——” in Shot 3.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA subtle, low, tense ambient bed at most, never covering the dialogue or sound effects; otherwise N/A.",
