      "promptInput": "参考图1为[苏婉-基础形象]的角色四视图。\n参考图2为[守墓人首领-基础形象]的角色四视图。\n\n【剧情】\n【0 s - 7 s】中景，平视机位。承接上一镜通讯全盲的落点， 城市地下管网核心区域-基础形象 内昏暗环境被应急灯冷光笼罩， @图片1(苏婉) 手持 警用战术枪-基础形象 警惕瞄准管道深处，随着一阵金属摩擦声， @图片2(守墓人首领) 从阴影中缓步走出，在距 @图片1(苏婉) 数米处站定。 @图片1(苏婉) 瞬间绷紧，举起 警用战术枪-基础形象 指向 @图片2(守墓人首领)，声音紧绷：“你？守墓人首领是你？！” 镜头切至 @图片2(守墓人首领) 面部特写，其嘴角缓缓上扬，阴冷笑意浮现。\n【7 s - 15 s】近景，平视机位。承接 @图片2(守墓人首领) 阴冷笑意的落点， @图片2(守墓人首领) 直视镜头方向，眼神充满蛊惑，冷冷说道：“我是周队退休前最忠诚的副手。他们说我疯了，说我被古法侵蚀。但你们，只是被系统绑架的提线木偶。” 随着台词落下，镜头缓慢推向 @图片2(守墓人首领) 脸部，画面定格于 @图片2(守墓人首领) 嘴角保持的弧度，在 城市地下管网核心区域-基础形象 死寂的管道阴影中，三方对峙的僵局成型。\n\n视频全程不要字幕、不要屏幕文字；必须保留协调统一的全局BGM和必要环境音，禁止静音段。\n\nVisual style: 采用现代都市真人写实风格，融合电影摄影、都市生活纪实与高级时尚人像美学。整体真实、自然、克制、有质感，强调真实人物、自然肤质、真实布光与现代城市环境，具有高品质都市短剧、电影剧照与商业人像摄影质感。以下规则仅作用于当前生成目标；未涉及内容不得主动添加。\n【整体画面风格】\n采用电影级真人摄影质感，自然光与真实布光优先，可结合窗光、阴天漫射光、街灯、店铺暖光与城市环境光。肤色自然，阴影柔和真实，保持合理曝光与冷暖关系。使用浅景深、自然散景、轻微胶片颗粒与真实镜头质感，画面细腻但不过度锐化。\n4K/8K高清，真实皮肤质感，电影级光影，真实摄影，强空间纵深。避免3D CG、二次元、塑料皮肤、过度磨皮、假HDR、过曝、高饱和滤镜、赛博朋克、影棚假光、人物抠图感与AI感。",
      "promptFinal": "｜产线原文\nsubject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is Su Wan (苏婉), the young East Asian woman defined by <Picture 1>: chin-length dark bob with center part, calm resolute expression, natural skin texture, wearing a dark navy zip-up tactical jacket over a black top, dark cargo pants, and black lace-up combat boots. She holds the police tactical gun (警用战术枪) in a two-handed grip.\n<Subject 2> is the Gravekeeper Leader (守墓人首领)， the older East Asian man (~50s–60s) defined by <Picture 2>: messy gray-streaked hair, weathered gaunt face, goatee, sunken intense eyes, wearing a worn stained dark-blue work jacket with brownish shoulder boards and a small badge, grubby light shirt underneath, faded dark work pants, and scuffed black shoes.\n<Subject 3> is the environment: the underground city pipe-network core area (城市地下管网核心区域)， dim and cavernous, lit only by cold emergency lights, with deep pipe shadows, damp concrete surfaces, and a dead-silent atmosphere.\n<Subject 4> is the police tactical gun (警用战术枪， basic form), a compact dark tactical firearm held two-handed by <Subject 1> and kept steadily aimed.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 12-second live-action cinematic confrontation in <Subject 3>, the dim underground pipe-network core area. <Subject 1> Su Wan, whose face, hair, and costume fidelity come from <Picture 1>, aims <Subject 4> into the pipe depths as <Subject 2> the Gravekeeper Leader, whose weathered appearance comes from <Picture 2>, slowly emerges from the shadows with a metallic scraping sound. She tenses and speaks her line; the shot cuts to a close-up of his cold rising smirk as he delivers his monologue, the camera slowly pushes in, and the frame freezes on his smirk, sealing the three-way standoff deadlock. No subtitles or on-screen text; continuous global BGM and ambient sound with no muted segments.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Su Wan's dark bob, navy tactical jacket, black top, cargo pants, combat boots, and resolute features from <Picture 1> are retained exactly.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the Gravekeeper Leader's weathered gaunt face, messy gray hair, goatee, sunken eyes, and worn dark-blue work jacket from <Picture 2> are retained exactly, dominating the Shot 2 close-up.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the dim pipe-network core area with cold emergency-light glow and deep pipe shadows is the sole setting throughout.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the police tactical gun is held two-handed and kept steadily aimed; it does not appear in Shot 2.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a modern urban live-action realistic style with cinematic photography: cold practical emergency lighting, natural skin texture, shallow depth of field, subtle film grain, and restrained, oppressive tension. No subtitles or on-screen text appear at any point.\n[Shot 1] The scene opens on a static eye-level medium shot inside <Subject 3>, the underground pipe-network core area, where cold emergency lights cast a pale blue-white glow over damp concrete and receding rows of dark pipes. <Subject 1> Su Wan, matching <Picture 1> exactly, frames left of center, holding <Subject 4>, the police tactical gun, in a steady two-handed grip aimed warily into the pipe depths, her body coiled and alert. At around 1.5s a metallic scraping sound rises from the shadows ahead of her aim line, and <Subject 2> the Gravekeeper Leader, matching <Picture 2> exactly, slowly steps out of the darkness, his worn dark-blue work jacket catching the cold light, and stops a few meters from her. Su Wan instantly snaps taut, raising the gun to point directly at him, her eyes widening with disbelief. At ~4.5s she says in a tight, strained voice, <d>[Chinese] 你？守墓人首领是你？！</d> Her finger stays on the trigger guard as the tension peaks.\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.500, the shot cuts to an eye-level close-up of <Subject 2>'s face, the dead pipe shadows soft behind him, cold emergency light carving the weathered lines of his gaunt face. His mouth corner slowly curls upward into a cold, sinister smirk. He stares forward with mesmerizing, sunken eyes and says in a low, cold, hypnotic voice, <d>[Chinese] 我是周队退休前最忠诚的副手。他们说我疯了，说我被古法侵蚀。但你们，只是被系统绑架的提线木偶。</d> As the line lands, the camera executes a slow, steady push-in toward his face. In the final frames the image freezes on the held arc of his smirk, the three-way standoff deadlock forming in the dead-silent pipe shadows.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA continuous diegetic ambient layer runs through the full 12 seconds with no muted segments: low pipe hum, distant water drips, and the metallic scraping sound as the Gravekeeper Leader emerges (~1.5–3s). Dialogue is dry and close, matching the enclosed concrete space.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA continuous unified global BGM spans the entire video: a low, tense, slowly building underscore with dark sustained strings and a faint sub-bass pulse, never swelling abruptly, holding the oppressive standoff atmosphere through the final freeze.",
