      "promptFinal": "中文复现PE｜2026-11-16素材清理修订；非历史产线PE，视频未重新生成。\n【有效输入与角色对应】\n参考图1对应原始输入图1。保留其人物身份、发型、服装等与本片有关的特征；场景按下文明确描述生成，不将人物四视图当作场景图。\n参考图2对应原始输入图2。保留其人物身份、发型、服装等与本片有关的特征；场景按下文明确描述生成，不将人物四视图当作场景图。\n【声音来源】\n本例无外部参考音频文件；人物声音、环境声和音效按文字描述生成。\n【中文复现PE】\n（旁白统一用女声）【角色锁定】[Reference Image 1]沈清澜，清冷犀利成年女声。[Reference Image 2]顾廷洲，尖细油腻中年男声。【场景锁定】@地下暗门旁。【视频风格】真人电影感，写实表演，自然光影，实拍级皮肤质感与毛发细节。【镜头1，0-3秒】中景，场景为@地下暗门旁内容：昏暗的安全通道内，[Reference Image 2]顾廷洲 喘着粗气，一把拽住[Reference Image 1]沈清澜 的手腕，眼神狰狞，身体微微前倾。运镜：固定镜头。台词：[Reference Image 2]顾廷洲（咬牙切齿）：“沈清澜！你少在这借刀杀人”音效：粗重的喘息声，衣物摩擦声。【镜头2，3-6秒】切镜到近景，场景仍为@地下暗门旁内容：[Reference Image 2]顾廷洲 面部特写，眉头紧锁，表情凶狠，嘴角抽动。运镜：镜头向主体缓慢推进。台词：[Reference Image 2]顾廷洲：“那份信托根本就没有给我任何私钥！”音效：低频背景音，营造压抑感。【镜头3，6-8.5秒】切镜到中景，场景仍为@地下暗门旁内容：[Reference Image 1]沈清澜 猛地甩开手腕，冷笑，嘴角上扬，眼神轻蔑地看着[Reference Image 2]顾廷洲 。运镜：跟拍[Reference Image 1]沈清澜 的动作。台词：[Reference Image 1]沈清澜（冷笑）：“这就急了？”音效：手腕甩开的“啪”声，轻微的脚步移动声。【镜头4，8.5-10秒】切镜到近景，场景仍为@地下暗门旁内容：[Reference Image 1]沈清澜 面部特写，眼神冷冽，直视前方，语气平静却充满威胁。运镜：固定镜头。台词：[Reference Image 1]沈清澜：“你骗小雅跳楼的时候，怎么没想到因果报应？”音效：静默，突出台词的冷峻感。\n【原始产线PE｜用于追溯当前视频】\nsubject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is 沈清澜 (Shen Qinglan), the young East Asian woman in <Picture 1> — long straight black hair, fair skin, cool aloof expression, red lips, pearl earring, white silk blouse under a black tailored blazer, dark grey mini skirt, sheer black stockings, black loafers. She has a cool, sharp adult female voice and a cold, contemptuous demeanor.\n<Subject 2> is 顾廷洲 (Gu Tingzhou), the middle-aged heavyset East Asian man in <Picture 2> — messy black hair, round face, purple floral brocade blazer over a floral print shirt, brown trousers, black shoes. He has a shrill, greasy middle-aged male voice and a rage-prone, menacing demeanor.\n<Subject 3> is the environment: a dim underground safety corridor beside a hidden door (暗门) — cold concrete walls, metal door frame, low-key natural lighting, claustrophobic shadows with a faint warm spill from above; <Picture 3> serves as the tonal/lighting reference for the upscale property's warm-versus-shadow contrast.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 10-second live-action cinematic confrontation beside an underground hidden door. <Subject 2> 顾廷洲 violently grabs the wrist of <Subject 1> 沈清澜 and snarls accusations about manipulation and the trust's private keys; she wrenches free with a cold sneer and delivers a chilling final line about karma. <Picture 1> and <Picture 2> provide identity and wardrobe for the two subjects; <Picture 3> provides lighting and upscale-mood reference only. No video or audio assets are used.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - her long black hair, black blazer, white blouse, pearl earring, and cool sharp female voice are retained throughout.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - his heavyset build, purple floral brocade blazer, floral shirt, and shrill greasy male voice are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the dim corridor, hidden door, concrete and metal textures, and low-key lighting persist across all shots.\n<Picture 1>: fully_preserved - identity and wardrobe reference for <Subject 1> in all her appearances.\n<Picture 2>: fully_preserved - identity and wardrobe reference for <Subject 2> in Shots 1–2.\n<Picture 3> (lighting/mood reference): weak_reference - only its warm-versus-shadow tonal contrast informs the corridor's lighting; the dining-room interior itself does not appear.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a live-action cinematic scene in a dim underground safety corridor beside a hidden door, with realistic acting, film-grade skin texture and hair detail, natural low-key lighting, and cold concrete and metal textures under claustrophobic shadows with a faint warm spill suggesting the upscale property above.\n[Shot 1] A fixed medium shot beside the hidden door. <Subject 2> 顾廷洲， in his purple floral brocade blazer from <Picture 2>, breathes heavily, chest heaving, and violently seizes the wrist of <Subject 1> 沈清澜， who wears her black blazer and white blouse from <Picture 1>. His body leans forward, eyes ferocious and bloodshot, and through gritted teeth he snarls in his shrill greasy middle-aged male voice, <d>[Chinese] 沈清澜！你少在这借刀杀人</d> Heavy panting and the friction of fabric fill the sound.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, the shot cuts to a close-up of <Subject 2>'s face, brows knotted tightly, expression vicious, the corner of his mouth twitching. The camera pushes in slowly toward him as he spits out his defense in the same shrill voice, <d>[Chinese] 那份信托根本就没有给我任何私钥！</d> A low-frequency oppressive background tone builds beneath his words.\n[Shot 3] At 00:06.000, the shot cuts to a medium shot; the camera tracks <Subject 1>'s movement as she sharply wrenches her wrist free with an audible sharp slap of skin and fabric, a faint scuff of her loafers on the concrete floor. A cold sneer curls her lips upward, her eyes contemptuous as she looks at <Subject 2>, and she says coolly in her sharp adult female voice, <d>[Chinese] 这就急了？</d>\n[Shot 4] At 00:08.500, the shot cuts to a fixed close-up of <Subject 1>'s face. Her gaze is icy, staring straight ahead, expression calm yet full of threat. In near-total silence that isolates the line, she delivers in a level, quietly menacing female voice, <d>[Chinese] 你骗小雅跳楼的时候，怎么没想到因果报应？</d> The video ends on her unblinking cold stare.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nHeavy panting and fabric friction in the corridor (Shot 1); a low-frequency oppressive background tone (Shot 2); the sharp \"啪\" slap of the wrist being freed and faint footstep movement (Shot 3); near-total silence isolating the final line (Shot 4). A faint low room-tone hum of the underground space persists throughout.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone; the low-frequency tone in Shot 2 functions only as a subtle pressure bed within the scene's ambience.",
